<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: adrenal heart -->
  <AdrenalHeart.label>激素心脏</AdrenalHeart.label>
  <!-- EN: A modified human heart that can release stress hormones and liquid energy into the bloodstream, allowing a ghoul to move and attack at incredible speeds. -->
  <AdrenalHeart.description>这件特制的活铁假体可使食尸鬼激素充盈、血脉偾张、代谢旺盛、渴求食物，短时间内爆发出惊人的移动和攻击能力。\n\n由于这种假体会给植入者带来极大的痛苦，仅有食尸鬼能够承受如此的强化。</AdrenalHeart.description>
  
  <!-- EN: corrosive heart -->
  <CorrosiveHeart.label>酸液心脏</CorrosiveHeart.label>
  <!-- EN: A modified human heart that allows a ghoul to spray corrosive fluid. -->
  <CorrosiveHeart.description>这件特制的活铁假体将食尸鬼的一个心室改造成分泌强酸的器官，使得被改造者可从口中喷射腐蚀性酸液。\n\n由于这种假体会给植入者带来极大的痛苦，仅有食尸鬼能够承受如此的强化。</CorrosiveHeart.description>
  
  <!-- EN: fleshmass lung -->
  <FleshmassLung.label>血肉肺</FleshmassLung.label>
  <!-- EN: A cancerous mass of semi-sentient flesh. The tissue constantly regrows and replaces itself, making it immune to effects like lung rot and asthma.\n\nThe organ has its own neural structures and may become dangerous if removed. -->
  <FleshmassLung.description>一块有不完全知觉的肿瘤血肉肺。其上组织不断再生更替，能使安装者免疫肺瘟、哮喘等疾病。\n\n这个器官有自己的神经结构，将其移除可能招致危险。</FleshmassLung.description>
  <!-- EN: Fleshmass operation -->
  <FleshmassLung.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>血肉手术</FleshmassLung.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Attempting to remove {PAWN_nameDef}'s fleshmass lung has caused the twisting mass of flesh to attack. The fleshmass has detached from {PAWN_nameDef} and transformed into a fleshbeast! -->
  <FleshmassLung.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>试图移除{PAWN_nameDef}体内血肉肺的手术让这团扭曲的肉有了攻击性。它从{PAWN_nameDef}身上分离后变成了一只血肉兽！</FleshmassLung.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>
  <!-- EN: a fleshmass lung -->
  <FleshmassLung.labelNoun>血肉肺</FleshmassLung.labelNoun>
  
  <!-- EN: fleshmass stomach -->
  <FleshmassStomach.label>血肉胃</FleshmassStomach.label>
  <!-- EN: A cancerous mass of semi-sentient flesh. The harsh acid it produces is painful, but strong enough to prevent most food poisoning.\n\nThe organ has its own neural structures and may become dangerous if removed. -->
  <FleshmassStomach.description>一块有不完全知觉的肿瘤血肉胃。其中含有的强酸会给安装者带来痛苦，但也能完全避免食物中毒。\n\n这个器官有自己的神经结构，将其移除可能招致危险。</FleshmassStomach.description>
  <!-- EN: Fleshmass operation -->
  <FleshmassStomach.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>血肉手术</FleshmassStomach.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Attempting to remove {PAWN_nameDef}'s fleshmass stomach has caused the twisting mass of flesh to attack. The fleshmass has detached from {PAWN_nameDef} and transformed into a fleshbeast! -->
  <FleshmassStomach.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>试图移除{PAWN_nameDef}体内血肉胃的手术让这团扭曲的肉有了攻击性。它从{PAWN_nameDef}身上分离后变成了一只血肉兽！</FleshmassStomach.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>
  <!-- EN: a fleshmass stomach -->
  <FleshmassStomach.labelNoun>血肉胃</FleshmassStomach.labelNoun>
  
  <!-- EN: flesh whip -->
  <FleshWhip.label>血肉触鞭</FleshWhip.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshy, muscled tentacle with a blade at the end. The flesh whip makes an excellent melee weapon.\n\nIt has its own neural structures and may become dangerous if removed. -->
  <FleshWhip.description>强健发达、末端带刃的肉乎乎触手。这只血肉触鞭算是不错的近战武器。\n\n这个部件有自己的神经结构，将其移除可能招致危险。</FleshWhip.description>
  <!-- EN: blade -->
  <FleshWhip.comps.HediffComp_VerbGiver.tools.blade.label>镰刃</FleshWhip.comps.HediffComp_VerbGiver.tools.blade.label>
  <!-- EN: Fleshmass operation -->
  <FleshWhip.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>血肉手术</FleshWhip.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Attempting to remove {PAWN_nameDef}'s flesh whip has caused the twisting mass of flesh to attack. The fleshmass has detached from {PAWN_nameDef} and transformed into a fleshbeast! -->
  <FleshWhip.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>试图移除{PAWN_nameDef}身上血肉触鞭的手术让这团扭曲的肉有了攻击性。它从{PAWN_nameDef}身上分离后变成了一只血肉兽！</FleshWhip.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>
  <!-- EN: a flesh whip -->
  <FleshWhip.labelNoun>血肉触鞭</FleshWhip.labelNoun>
  
  <!-- EN: ghoul barbs -->
  <GhoulBarbs.label>食尸鬼钩刺</GhoulBarbs.label>
  <!-- EN: A number of barbed bioferrite spikes have been surgically attached to this ghoul. -->
  <GhoulBarbs.description>这种活铁制的钩状棘刺可通过手术移植到食尸鬼身上，并极大地提升其近战伤害，但也限制了被改造者的动作范围，拖慢速度。\n\n由于这种假体会给植入者带来极大的痛苦，仅有食尸鬼能够承受如此的强化。</GhoulBarbs.description>
  <!-- EN: Ghoul spikes -->
  <GhoulBarbs.renderNodeProperties.0.debugLabel>食尸鬼刺钉</GhoulBarbs.renderNodeProperties.0.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: Ghoul spikes -->
  <GhoulBarbs.renderNodeProperties.1.debugLabel>食尸鬼刺钉</GhoulBarbs.renderNodeProperties.1.debugLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: ghoul plating -->
  <GhoulPlating.label>食尸鬼护板</GhoulPlating.label>
  <!-- EN: A number of large bioferrite plates have been surgically attached to this ghoul. -->
  <GhoulPlating.description>这种活铁制的护板可通过手术移植到食尸鬼身上，保护其脆弱部位，显著降低受到的伤害，但也拖慢了被改造者的速度。\n\n由于这种假体会给植入者带来极大的痛苦，仅有食尸鬼能够承受如此的强化。</GhoulPlating.description>
  <!-- EN: Ghoul plates -->
  <GhoulPlating.renderNodeProperties.0.debugLabel>食尸鬼护板</GhoulPlating.renderNodeProperties.0.debugLabel>
  
  <!-- EN: metalblood heart -->
  <MetalbloodHeart.label>钢血心脏</MetalbloodHeart.label>
  <!-- EN: A modified human heart that can pump metalblood into the bloodstream, making the ghoul more resistant to damage for a short period of time. Metalblood also makes the ghoul more vulnerable to fire. -->
  <MetalbloodHeart.description>这件特制的活铁假体能够向食尸鬼的血液中泵入小剂量的钢血，使其在短时间内能够抵御更多伤害，但会引发被改造者大面积水肿，并拖慢移动速度，而且面对火焰时会变得更加脆弱。\n\n由于这种假体会给植入者带来极大的痛苦，仅有食尸鬼能够承受如此的强化。</MetalbloodHeart.description>
  
  <!-- EN: revenant vertebrae -->
  <RevenantVertebrae.label>幽魂脊椎</RevenantVertebrae.label>
  <!-- EN: An installed prosthetic that allows the user to temporarily become invisible. The prosthetic is crafted from a modified revenant spine, using archotech shards to restrain the dormant revenant. The user can manipulate the visual centers of those nearby, effectively turning themself invisible for a short time. -->
  <RevenantVertebrae.description>能够让植入者暂时隐形的假体。此件假体由幽魂的脊椎改造而来，并用暗黑超凡碎片来抑制其中的幽魂。植入者可操控周围单位的视觉中枢，短时间内让自己处于有效隐形的状态。</RevenantVertebrae.description>
  
  <!-- EN: flesh tentacle -->
  <Tentacle.label>血肉触手</Tentacle.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshy, muscled tentacle resembling a partial transformation into a fleshbeast. The tentacle is excellent at manipulation.\n\nThe flesh tentacle has its own neural structures and may become dangerous if removed. -->
  <Tentacle.description>强健发达、已经有点血肉兽样子的肉乎乎触手。这只触手操控起来还是非常趁手的。\n\n这只血肉触手有自己的神经结构，将其移除可能招致危险。</Tentacle.description>
  <!-- EN: Fleshmass operation -->
  <Tentacle.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>血肉手术</Tentacle.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterLabel>
  <!-- EN: Attempting to remove {PAWN_nameDef}'s tentacle has caused the twisting mass of flesh to attack. The fleshmass has detached from {PAWN_nameDef} and transformed into a fleshbeast! -->
  <Tentacle.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>试图移除{PAWN_nameDef}身上血肉触手的手术让这团扭曲的肉有了攻击性。它从{PAWN_nameDef}身上分离后变成了一只血肉兽！</Tentacle.comps.HediffComp_FleshbeastEmerge.letterText>
  <!-- EN: a flesh tentacle -->
  <Tentacle.labelNoun>血肉触手</Tentacle.labelNoun>
  
</LanguageData>